# start Validation Reply Form
_vrf_PLAT029_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: _diffrn_measured_fraction_theta_full value Low .      0.457 Why?  
RESPONSE: The data come from high-pressure studies and are limited by the DAC opening angle.
;
_vrf_PLAT026_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: Ratio Observed / Unique Reflections (too) Low ..        33% Check 
RESPONSE: The data come from high-pressure studies and are limited by the DAC opening angle.
;
_vrf_PLAT084_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: High wR2 Value (i.e. > 0.25) ...................       0.38 Report
RESPONSE: We made several attempts to obtain better quality data for this structure however, due to absorption of the sample, disorder, poor crystal quality etc. crystal diffracted weakly. Furthermore the data come from high-pressure studies and are limited by the DAC opening angle.
;
_vrf_PLAT341_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: Low Bond Precision on  C-C Bonds ...............    0.03462 Ang.  
RESPONSE: The data come from high-pressure studies and are limited by the DAC opening angle.
;
_vrf_PLAT088_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: Poor Data / Parameter Ratio ....................       7.81 Note  
RESPONSE: Crystals diffracted extremely weakly. However, all yielded serious problems due to weak diffraction, low symmetry and DAC.
;
_vrf_PLAT910_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: Missing # of FCF Reflection(s) Below Theta(Min).         17 Note  
RESPONSE: Crystals diffracted extremely weakly. However, all yielded serious problems due to weak diffraction, low symmetry and DAC.
;
_vrf_PLAT911_1_08_GPa_FC-77            
;
PROBLEM: Missing FCF Refl Between Thmin & STh/L=    0.600       1442 Report
RESPONSE: Crystals diffracted extremely weakly. However, all yielded serious problems due to weak diffraction, low symmetry and DAC.
;
# end Validation Reply Form
